00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,740
♪ Watch me leap forward ♪

4
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,990
♪ Fall and rise ♪

5
00:01:04,019 --> 00:01:06,240
♪ I am brave ♪

6
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:10,690
♪ You will find, find your way ♪

7
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,430
This is for you.

8
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:13,480
♪ Win or lose ♪

9
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:18,640
♪ I'm fighting through to the end ♪

10
00:01:19,810 --> 00:01:24,030
♪ Just to breathe again ♪

11
00:01:27,789 --> 00:01:28,789
This is the place.

12
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:30,230
Guys,

13
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:32,070
please stop what you're doing.

14
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,310
Today,

15
00:01:33,310 --> 00:01:35,229
we have a new member
joining our publicity team,

16
00:01:35,229 --> 00:01:36,200
Song Baiwei.

17
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,710
She has prepared a

18
00:01:37,710 --> 00:01:38,920
charity sale and fundraising plan.

19
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,850
Let's listen to what she has to say.

20
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,870
Welcome! Great! Welcome!

21
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,039
Here's the thing.

22
00:01:52,530 --> 00:01:53,479
Previously,

23
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,710
I thought of a plan.

24
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,130
Our country is in a time of crisis.

25
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,560
You can take a look first.

26
00:01:59,070 --> 00:02:00,760
Since I am good at painting,

27
00:02:01,450 --> 00:02:03,220
I plan to hold a charity sale.

28
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,640
Baiwei.

29
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,230
Go on.

30
00:02:07,410 --> 00:02:09,120
Your painting is in the newspaper again.
Look!

31
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,380
It's in the newspaper!

32
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,640
That's great!

33
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,680
Let me see.

34
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,530
What does it say?

35
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,750
This is good.

36
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,840
Yeah.

37
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,840
Commander Ning compensates
a fallen subordinate

38
00:02:25,860 --> 00:02:27,790
and adopts his orphaned daughter.

39
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:35,829
Let's see.

40
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:36,829
Let's see.

41
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:38,610
Go over there.

42
00:02:38,610 --> 00:02:39,480
Let's go. Let's go.

43
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:40,290
Let's appreciate it.

44
00:02:40,290 --> 00:02:41,090
What's wrong?

45
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:43,030
Nothing.

46
00:02:43,570 --> 00:02:45,180
Why aren't you heading home to rest?

47
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:45,980
Didn't you say

48
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,560
that recently

49
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:50,120
you've been driving the cinema boss
to and from work

50
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,120
just to get us this activity room?

51
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:53,970
Aren't you tired?

52
00:02:53,990 --> 00:02:54,990
I'm not tired.

53
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:57,790
Watching you write is my way of resting.

54
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,120
Baiwei,

55
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:06,070
let's go watch a movie tomorrow.

56
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:08,030
I'm not going.

57
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,910
Why?

58
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,430
Just the two of us watching a movie...

59
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,470
that's so boring.

60
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,880
If you're so capable,

61
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:18,320
invite everyone to go.

62
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:23,800
Tomorrow I'm treating everyone to a movie!

63
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:25,570
Great!

64
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,310
That's wonderful!

65
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,280
Dad...

66
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,200
Go home right now.

67
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,680
Not now.

68
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,630
I'll go back when I'm done here.

69
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:42,130
What are you busy with?

70
00:03:42,590 --> 00:03:44,000
Hanging out with these people

71
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,190
in this place,

72
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:47,360
doing all this nonsense every day!

73
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,400
Go home!

74
00:03:49,070 --> 00:03:50,780
You are getting engaged
to Miss Chen next month.

75
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:52,850
Never touch any of this again.

76
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:54,800
Who is this?

77
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:55,910
The president of Zhiyuan
Chamber of Commerce.

78
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:57,840
I can't believe he's Lin's father.

79
00:04:04,830 --> 00:04:05,480
Dad,

80
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,590
do you know how the Chen family

81
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:08,030
made their fortune?

82
00:04:08,430 --> 00:04:09,630
Smuggling medicines

83
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,680
and profiteering from the national crisis!

84
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,000
You...

85
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,530
And also,

86
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:13,870
the family business
you want me to inherit...

87
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:16,430
the textile mills,
grain stores, and pawnshops...

88
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:17,640
you hoard supplies

89
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,420
and tripled the price of rice!

90
00:04:19,630 --> 00:04:21,029
Did you think I didn't know?

91
00:04:21,029 --> 00:04:21,829
How dare you!

92
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:27,610
Mr. Lin, this is an activity room.

93
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,830
It's not a place for you
to throw your weight around

94
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:30,360
and handle family matters.

95
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,560
Who do you think you are?

96
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,270
Are you okay, Lin Huai?

97
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,600
How dare you lecture me!

98
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,120
I am his friend,

99
00:04:36,770 --> 00:04:39,570
and also one of "these people"
you just mentioned.

100
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,830
Since you're here

101
00:04:41,850 --> 00:04:43,440
and publicly insulted us,

102
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,370
you should at least know

103
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:47,159
what we actually do here.

104
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,830
This is our schedule for the week.

105
00:04:53,990 --> 00:04:55,310
What we spread every day

106
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:57,409
are messages about saving our nation.

107
00:04:57,409 --> 00:04:58,440
We raise funds for the soldiers

108
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:01,200
on the front lines
who lack food and clothing.

109
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,740
It's where your medicine

110
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:04,860
and rice should have gone.

111
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,970
As for your son,

112
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:10,000
Lin Huai,

113
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:14,170
he is crying out for those
who starved to death

114
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,550
and those who froze to death.

115
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,280
You should thank him.

116
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:19,450
He runs around

117
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,720
to save the country from peril.

118
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,650
He has been accumulating virtue
for your Lin family.

119
00:05:27,350 --> 00:05:28,310
I just don't know

120
00:05:29,050 --> 00:05:31,200
if it can keep up
with the speed at which you lose it.

121
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,050
You!

122
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,480
Lin Huai!

123
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,840
Every cent you spend

124
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,310
belongs to the Lin family.

125
00:05:45,409 --> 00:05:47,530
Young Master, what are you doing?

126
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,510
Please stop!

127
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,000
Sir,

128
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,430
the Young Master is still young

129
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,040
and childish.

130
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,120
Please calm down.

131
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,640
You ungrateful son!

132
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,480
What are you doing?

133
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:02,180
You're right.

134
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,240
I've been spending

135
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,640
the dirty money you made.

136
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:09,290
Right now, I don't have

137
00:06:10,490 --> 00:06:12,350
a single cent from the Lin family.

138
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,360
And not a single thing

139
00:06:14,550 --> 00:06:16,010
bears the Lin family name.

140
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:18,720
From now on,

141
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,720
the Lin family and I

142
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:23,070
are completely through.

143
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,710
Baiwei, let's go.

144
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,840
Young Master.

145
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,240
Lin Huai!

146
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:32,020
If you walk away today,

147
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:33,220
don't ever come back!

148
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,560
So?

149
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,280
How do I look?

150
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,990
I'm sorry.

151
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:17,720
Not bad.

152
00:07:18,310 --> 00:07:19,750
Way better than your

153
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:21,190
rich kid clothes.

154
00:07:21,770 --> 00:07:22,700
You bet.

155
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,920
I bought this with the money

156
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,800
from pulling Miss Baiwei's rickshaw.

157
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,330
It feels amazing to wear it.

158
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:31,650
Stop messing around.

159
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:34,700
You know,

160
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:37,190
you're pretty and sweet,

161
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,390
and...

162
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,440
you really know how to curse people out.

163
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:43,880
In my whole life,

164
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,100
I've never seen my dad so speechless.

165
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,390
Is that a compliment?

166
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,120
Obviously.

167
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,750
You've got all three.

168
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,920
How rare.

169
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:59,530
♪ Do you see me? ♪

170
00:08:00,590 --> 00:08:03,280
♪ Do you hear me? ♪

171
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,280
♪ Just take a step ♪

172
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:11,030
♪ And try to see another way ♪

173
00:08:12,590 --> 00:08:15,530
