♪ Don't let me down ♪

196
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,280
Awesome!

197
00:09:42,300 --> 00:09:43,960
Just in time for the premiere.

198
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,440
I gotta get back to work.

199
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,520
Let's leave together tonight.

200
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,130
Okay.

201
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:34,970
Look at this.

202
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:36,580
Please.

203
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:44,320
Drawing is exhausting.

204
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,030
Look at me.

205
00:10:45,430 --> 00:10:46,430
Give me a smile.

206
00:10:48,990 --> 00:10:49,750
Lin Huai,

207
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:52,000
how old are you?

208
00:11:00,150 --> 00:11:00,980
My pen.

209
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,390
I need to draw.

210
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:04,030
Call me brother,

211
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:05,750
call me brother and it's yours.

212
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:06,700
Give it back.

213
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:08,280
Then you have to draw for me.

214
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,000
Call me brother and I will.

215
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,630
Or no pen for you.

216
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:11,790
In your dreams!

217
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:12,310
Hey!

218
00:11:12,330 --> 00:11:13,730
I have a deadline!

219
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:15,750
Lin Huai,

220
00:11:16,460 --> 00:11:17,860
aren't you

221
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:20,760
a bit childish?

222
00:11:58,420 --> 00:11:59,230
Baiwei,

223
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,840
I really love you.

224
00:12:03,430 --> 00:12:04,550
I love you so much.

225
00:12:06,650 --> 00:12:07,810
My life

226
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:09,960
was empty and dull.

227
00:12:10,310 --> 00:12:11,840
But falling in love with you

228
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:14,440
made it shine.

229
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:21,040
I can't promise you a lifetime of peace,

230
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,370
instead, I'm begging you.

231
00:12:25,030 --> 00:12:26,290
Begging you to grant me

232
00:12:28,260 --> 00:12:29,620
this endless honor.

233
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:43,030
Please marry me.

234
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:46,440
Let me stay by your side

235
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:49,510
lifetime after lifetime.

236
00:12:54,360 --> 00:13:06,510
Marry him!

237
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:25,110
Look.

238
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:28,810
This is our marriage certificate
from back then.

239
00:13:29,890 --> 00:13:31,730
Do you really not remember?

240
00:13:33,930 --> 00:13:35,100
No, I don't.

241
00:13:36,310 --> 00:13:37,580
You show up here today

242
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:39,000
with some photos

243
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,120
and a video,

244
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,040
make up some century-old story,

245
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:43,990
and expect me to believe

246
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:48,390
that we are Song Baiwei and Lin Huai
from a century ago?

247
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:52,090
It's absurd.

248
00:13:58,650 --> 00:13:59,820
I'm sorry.

249
00:14:00,650 --> 00:14:02,370
I'm not feeling well.

250
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,280
You should leave.

251
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,100
Wait.

252
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:17,840
I never once mentioned

253
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,140
the name Song Baiwei.

254
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:27,700
You remember.

255
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:31,110
You remember everything, don't you?

256
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:34,870
Why are you pretending not to know me?

257
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:36,760
We've known each other for so long.

258
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,790
Why...

259
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,630
Tell me.

260
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:45,440
Lin Huai...

261
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,780
About that marriage certificate
you gave me...

262
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:52,130
I thought it over.

263
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:55,120
Let's get through the fundraiser first.

264
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:55,750
It's okay.

265
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,360
When all this is over,

266
00:14:58,490 --> 00:14:59,950
I'll wait for your answer.

267
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,400
Why is the rain getting so heavy?

268
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:12,760
Where are you going?

269
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:15,580
I'll be right back.

270
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:16,540
Wait for me here.

271
00:16:59,590 --> 00:17:00,830
So tragic.

272
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:04,480
What happened?

273
00:17:04,619 --> 00:17:06,140
Who would do this?

274
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,160
Does anyone know him?

275
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,170
No one's even here for his body.

276
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:13,119
Yeah.

277
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:14,339
Poor guy.

278
00:17:16,069 --> 00:17:17,109
Exactly.

279
00:17:17,109 --> 00:17:18,310
He must've crossed the wrong people

280
00:17:18,310 --> 00:17:19,369
for this to happen.

281
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:34,350
Lin Huai.

282
00:17:34,730 --> 00:17:35,530
Lin Huai.

283
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,640
Lin Huai!

284
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,510
Lin Huai!

285
00:17:42,110 --> 00:17:43,110
Help!

286
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,680
Help!

287
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:45,960
Somebody help!

288
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,550
Lin Huai!

289
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:49,350
Lin Huai!

290
00:18:08,790 --> 00:18:10,480
Help!

291
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:15,350
Get a doctor!

292
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,850
Lin Huai!

293
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,550
Lin Huai!

294
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:27,160
Let's get you to a hospital.

295
