00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:30,350
Lin Huai, don't...

297
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:32,370
Don't die on me.

298
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:34,600
Please don't die.

299
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,850
Lin Huai!

300
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,440
The Lin Huai in my memory

301
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:18,520
died on the street just like that.

302
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,510
He died at the age of twenty.

303
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,200
His body was cold.

304
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:27,920
He never woke up again.

305
00:19:31,870 --> 00:19:33,800
Why are you pretending not to know me?

306
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:35,660
We've known each other for so long.

307
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:37,770
Why...

308
00:19:38,310 --> 00:19:39,590
Tell me.

309
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,090
Lin Huai.

310
00:19:44,130 --> 00:19:44,930
Director Lin.
